    <string name="settings_prices_title">Market prices</string>
    <string name="settings_prices_body">Prices for US listings come from Finnhub, using your own free personal API key. Prices for listings on the main European exchanges always come from Yahoo Finance, because Finnhub\'s free plan has none; they are delayed by about 15 to 20 minutes. The key is stored encrypted on this phone and sent only to Finnhub, together with ticker symbols. Without a key, prices come from Yahoo Finance\'s public pages: no key is needed, but that source is unofficial and may be delayed, limited or stop working at any time. Only ticker symbols are sent there.</string>
    <string name="key_guide_title">How to get a free key</string>
    <string name="key_guide_step1">1. Tap Get key from Finnhub. Finnhub opens in a browser tab; create a free account or sign in. This app never sees your Finnhub password.</string>
    <string name="key_guide_step2">2. On Finnhub, copy your API key.</string>
    <string name="key_guide_step3">3. Come back to this app: it offers to use the key you copied. You can also paste it below. The key is checked with one test request.</string>
